{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"遅くなりましたが"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"2.22のバースデーライブin西武ドーム"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"寒い中ありがとうございました～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/minami.hoshino/img/blog/minami.hoshino/img/2015/02/28/0487044/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなみのうちわとかタオルもたくさんみつけられた♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"何度目の青空か？のラストにファンの方がサプライズで風船を飛ばしてくれたのがすごい感動した！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おわってからみんなですごかったね！びっくりしたね！って話したんだよ～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/minami.hoshino/img/blog/minami.hoshino/img/2015/02/28/0487044/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"7時間半の全曲披露で\n懐かしい曲だったり初めて披露する曲もあったりでずっとどきどきしてた"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"バースデーライブでしか披露しない「ここじゃないどこか」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/minami.hoshino/img/blog/minami.hoshino/img/2015/02/28/0487044/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/minami.hoshino/img/blog/minami.hoshino/img/2015/02/28/0487044/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"アルバム曲の「なぞの落書き」が初披露♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"アルバム曲だから最初で最後の披露かもしれないからできてよかった～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ユニットは新鮮な感じで好きだからまたユニット曲できたらいいな٩꒰｡•◡•｡꒱۶"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/minami.hoshino/img/blog/minami.hoshino/img/2015/02/28/0487044/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それと初披露だった新曲！「命は美しい」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"衣装はこんな感じ♡かわい～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/minami.hoshino/img/blog/minami.hoshino/img/2015/02/28/0487044/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ダンスもすごいかっこよくて好き！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/minami.hoshino/img/blog/minami.hoshino/img/2015/02/28/0487044/0006.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつもと違うみんなに注目だね♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/minami.hoshino/img/blog/minami.hoshino/img/2015/02/28/0487044/0007.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/minami.hoshino/img/blog/minami.hoshino/img/2015/02/28/0487044/0008.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ライブに友達がみなみのタオル持って観に来てくれててちょっと恥ずかしかったけど幸せでした～♡♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/minami.hoshino/img/blog/minami.hoshino/img/2015/02/28/0487044/0009.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あとから聞いたら、お母さんがグッズ販売に4時間半も並んで友達にプレゼントしてたみたい笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"家に帰ったら自分のミニタオルがいっぱい笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"知り合いに配るんだって笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/minami.hoshino/img/blog/minami.hoshino/img/2015/02/28/0487044/0010.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"自分がいっぱいで不思議な気分"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"(´,,・ω・,,｀)笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/minami.hoshino/img/blog/minami.hoshino/img/2015/02/28/0487044/0011.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/minami.hoshino/img/blog/minami.hoshino/img/2015/02/28/0487044/0012.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/minami.hoshino/img/blog/minami.hoshino/img/2015/02/28/0487044/0013.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木どこのバレンタイン企画"},{"type":"brea